t("Shield Expertise", "Escudo Expertise", "talent name")
t("Improves your damage with shield-based skills, and increases your Spell (+%d) and Physical (+%d) Saves.", "Mejora tu daño con habilidades basadas en escudos, y aumentas tu Spell (+%d ) y Físico (+ %d ) Salva.", "tformat")
t("Last Stand", "Último stand", "talent name")
